{"meta":{"id":"scss-media","category":"it/programming-languages/css-scss","title":"SCSS 미디어 쿼리 정의","subtitle":"","summary":"media 사용 시 px 소수점 단위 오차 보정 (mixin)","tags":["scss","media query","반응형","mixin"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"blog: code/front/ScssMedia.jsx","updatedAt":"2024-12-04"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>SCSS</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2024-12-04</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">SCSS 미디어 쿼리 정의</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> media 사용 시 px 소수점 단위 오차 보정 (mixin)</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">media 사용시, px의 소수점 단위 오차 보정</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">//min-width (이상), max-width(이하)로 정의되어 있습니다.\r\n@media (min-width: $width ) and (max-width:$width) {\r\n    @content;\r\n}\r\n//하지만 px계산에 따라서 소수점 단위 오차로 연결이 안될 수 있어서\r\n//이래와 같이 scss를 사용할 때는 calc로 오차범위를 한번 줄여주는 것이 좋습니다.\r\n@media (min-width: calc($width - 0.1px) ) and (max-width: calc($width + 0.1px)) {\r\n    @content;\r\n}\r\n\r\n//mixin를 사용해서 생성해둔 후 함수 호출해서 사용하면 좀 더 편하게 사용가능합니다\r\n@mixin exactW($width) {\r\n    @media (min-width: calc($width - 0.1px) ) and (max-width: calc($width + 0.1px)) {\r\n        @content;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n//=&gt; 호출해서 사용\r\n@include exactW($breakpoint-desktop){ top: 30vh; }</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"it/programming-languages/css-scss/scss-media","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"programming-languages","title":"프로그램 언어","path":"it/programming-languages"},{"id":"css-scss","title":"CSS · SCSS","path":"it/programming-languages/css-scss"}],"hasImage":false}